        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-GNT625RDDSBR, Elegant Reed Refrigerator Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDress up your Sub Zero Refrigerator or other appliances with the Elegant Reed Appliance Door Pull. This decorative reed appliance pull handle has a slim, 5/8 inch diameter and is made of the high-quality brass. Hand finished in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions, the highly detailed reed design is accentuated by the array of finishes available. Choose from 8 inch, 10 inch, or 12 inch sizes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Garnet Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/810R-pull-detail-view.jpg?v=1704354553\"><b>First Impressions AP-GNT625RDDSBR Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>First Impressions AP-GNT625RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625008RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.56\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625010RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.56\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-GNT625012RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.56\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This cabinet pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
